Collected jobs

Scraped Tanitjobs.
Collected additional jobs from the Adzuna API.
Parsed and cleaned data

Extracted titles, companies, salaries, locations, experience, and descriptions.
Removed duplicates and standardized sectors.
Stored everything in PostgreSQL

Used tables for jobs, companies, sectors, sources, and extracted information.
Loaded both Tanitjobs and Adzuna data into the same database.
Extracted advanced information

Used rules and a local Ollama LLM to find:
Seniority
Remote work type
Tools
Skills
Evaluated the extraction

Created labeled development and test samples.
Compared LLM results and rule-based results using accuracy, precision, recall, and F1-score.
Added salary analysis

Standardized salaries into yearly values when possible.
Distinguished real employer salaries from predicted Adzuna salaries.
Compared salaries by country, sector, and seniority.
Created analytics

Prepared database views for market overview, sectors, tools, regions, salaries, and job trends.
Defined these views in analytics.sql.
Added automated daily processing

run_daily.py runs collection, parsing, database loading, extraction, and quality checks automatically.
Added data-quality monitoring

checks.py checks for missing sectors, stale data, invalid dates, duplicates, salary errors, and failed pipeline steps.





run : 
Initialize the PostgreSQL database : python -m src.database.init_db
Load Tanitjobs data : python -m src.database.load_tanitjobs
Load Adzuna data : python -m src.database.load_adzuna
Check database summaries : python -m src.database.summary
Check analytics views : python -m src.database.show_views
Run data-quality checks : python -m src.quality.checks
Check extraction coverage : python -m src.database.summary
Run LLM extraction : python -m src.extraction.llm_extract --gold
for extraction : python -m src.database.extract_all 
Run the complete daily pipeline : python -m src.pipeline.run_daily